!*/
!.gitignore
!**/*.md
!**/*.json
!**/*.jsonl.bz2
!**/patches/*.diff
!**/patches/*.patch
!**/dry-run/*.txt
!**/dryrun/*.txt
!**/dry-run/*.cfg
!**/dryrun/*.cfg
!**/events.jsonl

# Preserve decisions and evidence, not controller plumbing or duplicate inputs.
**/work/
**/WORKER.md
**/dry-run/image/
**/dryrun/image/
**/image/
**/*.stdout
**/*.stderr
**/*.log
**/*.pids
**/*.cid
**/*.lock
**/*.claimed
**/*.state
**/*.stamp
**/AGGREGATE-BUDGET-STOP
**/AGGREGATE-BUDGET-BREACH
**/RUNNING
**/ACTIVE
**/ORGANIZATION-ACTIVE
